  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]  [C]  [Bb]\n[Am]  [C]  [A7]\n[Dm]  [F]\n[Bb]  [A7sus4]  [A7]\n[Gm]  [A7sus4]  [A7]\n[Dm]  [C]\n[Bb]  [E]\n[Am]  [C]\n[F]\n\n[Solo]\n[Dm]\n[A]\n[D]\n[Gm]\n[D]\n[A]\n[A7]\n[E]\n[Am]\n[C]\n[F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]You talk of love,\nYou talk of\ntrust, But\nI can't see,\n[A]I sleep alone to mine,\nAnd where you\n[D]go, what you do\nBaby\n[Gm]I can't find,\nIt's not\n[D]easy to forget,\nThough\n[A]yesterday is far a-\n[A7]way\n[E]But still I can\n[Am]feel\n[C]You close as brea-\n[F]thing\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]You say you care\nYou want to\nknow But\nI don't know\n[A]Sleep alone tonight\nAnd in my\n[D]heart I feel you care\nMore than\n[Gm]you believe\nI'll\n[D]wait for you today\n[A]Hope tomorrow takes a-\n[A7]way\n[E]This yearning for\n[Am]a change\n[C]Look up at the new\n[F]life\n[C]I must find,\nI must find,\nI must find\n\n[Fade Out]",
